}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1010146731030828", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391815_1010146734364161_1108268336051029752_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ldQfW2spmQkQ7kNvwGATtpL&_nc_oc=AdorhTEKLDb7789wkfBCEobSVWOlicytE8WH-6Bv5G3FAcM2Jh0J6NBUm0CR9yGctvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2XHV7JQpEvFjgGt1RlGX4IsCMv9B9vw6sZBoNK6wr8iA&oe=69D7B0FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Insight Meditation", "keywords": ["meditation", "mindfulness", "vr", "yoga", "insight"], "long_description": "Discover the power of mindfulness with Insight Meditation VR, your gateway to deep relaxation and inner peace. Designed for both beginners and experienced meditators, this app offers a fully immersive meditation experience in breathtaking virtual environments.\n\nKey Features:\n\u2705 Immersive VR Meditation: Escape into serene nature, space, and artistic landscapes.\n\u2705 Guided & Silent Sessions: Choose from expert-led meditations or enjoy quiet contemplation.\n\u2705 Breath Visualization: Enhance your mindfulness with interactive breathwork.\n\u2705 Soothing Soundscapes: Relax with calming music and natural ambiance.\n\u2705 Free & Pro Content: Access 15 free meditations or unlock 50+ premium sessions with regular updates.\n\nStep into a world of tranquility and transform your meditation practice with Insight Meditation VR. Download now and begin your journey to mindfulness.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in deep relaxation with Insight Meditation VR. Explore stunning virtual landscapes, guided meditations, breath visualizations, and soothing music. Enjoy a free selection of meditative experiences, or unlock the Pro version for an ever-growing library of immersive sessions. Elevate your mindfulness journey with VR-powered serenity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/cd85b7ef-d2e